WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.140
A message for your ex-boyfriend.

2
00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:02.540
Everything that is nice lasts a short time.

3
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:04.000
Oh, so it was nice.

4
00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:04.560
Well, yes.

5
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.220
Someone has something nice to say, too.

6
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:07.120
A message for the ex.

7
00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:08.520
I blocked him, there is no message for him.

8
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.320
So there is no message for him, and why is that?

9
00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:11.140
Because he lied.

10
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.160
And what did he lie about?

11
00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:14.220
He lied about a lot of things, man.

12
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:15.560
And rightly so.

13
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.540
Do you want to say his name so we can call him out?

14
00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.120
No need, man, come on, let us keep it secret.

15
00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:22.080
Like this clip and follow me.
